entralized, market-based accountability mechanisms, we replace static, pre-deployment mandates with dynamic resilience. We do not need more gatekeepers; we need more bandwidth. The choice is between stagnant safety, which leaves us vulnerable to faster-moving threats, and dynamic resilience, which utilizes the full power of autonomous capabilities to secure our future. 🚀",
